WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:01.439
- I cannot wait to see you!

00:00:01.439 --> 00:00:03.436
Alright, see you soon, bye.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.969
- Hey, do you wanna go to Lauren's party

00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:06.176
with me on Saturday?

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:08.607
- Oh, I just made plans with your Mom.

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:11.197
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:14.507
- No one's liked my status yet,

00:00:14.507 --> 00:00:15.668
will you like it?

00:00:15.668 --> 00:00:17.734
- Yeah.
- [Ali] Thanks.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.429
- It's not funny though.

00:00:19.429 --> 00:00:21.449
Hey, I'm using your curling iron!

00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:22.215
It's freezing in here.

00:00:22.215 --> 00:00:23.539
- [Ali] It is so hot!

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:24.328
- [Lily] Are you freaking kidding me,

00:00:24.328 --> 00:00:25.234
it's freezing!

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.929
Do you wanna come to San Diego

00:00:26.929 --> 00:00:29.506
with my whole family at
the end of the month?

00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:30.871
- To visit Uncle Jack?
- [Lily] Yup.

00:00:30.871 --> 00:00:32.334
- Oh my God yes, I miss him!

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.447
- He misses you too, he
was talking about you.

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:35.213
Mom?

00:00:35.213 --> 00:00:36.699
Ok this is for you.

00:00:36.699 --> 00:00:40.159
- [Both] Happy Birthday!

00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:41.274
- Love you, Gina!

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:43.758
- It's me and Ali, we love you!

00:00:43.758 --> 00:00:46.900
- Your Dad just liked 14
of my Facebook statuses.

00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:48.345
- Hey, I'm up.

00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:50.365
Are you up?
- No.

00:00:50.365 --> 00:00:52.408
- C'mon, let's go to brunch.

00:00:52.408 --> 00:00:54.196
- It is so bright out, it's so early!

00:00:54.196 --> 00:00:55.519
- It's not early, it's 10.

00:00:55.519 --> 00:00:56.430
- Lily?

00:00:58.793 --> 00:01:00.847
I'm just coming to get that red shirt.

00:01:00.847 --> 00:01:01.567
- We're going.

00:01:01.567 --> 00:01:04.190
- Why are you making me
go to brunch before noon?

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:05.816
- [Lily] People go to brunch at 10.

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:07.534
- Nobody goes to brunch at 10!

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.136
- Hey, I'm using your bronzer.

00:01:09.136 --> 00:01:11.017
Hey, I'm using your deoderant.

00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:12.387
You look really good in this picture.

00:01:12.387 --> 00:01:13.664
- Oh thank you!

00:01:13.664 --> 00:01:14.732
- Did you borrow my shirt?

00:01:14.732 --> 00:01:17.448
- Yeah I came over to get it
last week with the spare key.

00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:19.097
- Also your Mom looks amazing.

00:01:19.097 --> 00:01:21.651
- But he said, "Well what are
you doing tonight instead?"

00:01:21.651 --> 00:01:22.580
- Oh that's great.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.043
- [Ali] And I said, "I don't
know, I don't have any plans.

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:27.015
"I'm currently laying in my
bed spooning a bag of chips."

00:01:27.015 --> 00:01:28.812
- Wait, did you already send that?

00:01:28.812 --> 00:01:31.458
You have to run all your texts
by me before you press send.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:32.596
What are you doing?

00:01:32.596 --> 00:01:34.477
- [Ali] I'm turning left.
- No, we're gonna be going...

00:01:34.477 --> 00:01:35.336
I thought we were going straight!

00:01:35.336 --> 00:01:37.547
Go straight, what are you...

00:01:37.547 --> 00:01:38.568
go straight!

00:01:38.568 --> 00:01:40.403
If he wanted to go on a date with you,

00:01:40.403 --> 00:01:41.703
I think you would know by now.

00:01:41.703 --> 00:01:43.143
- That's it, and if he wanted
to go on a date with me,

00:01:43.143 --> 00:01:44.257
he would go on a date with me!

00:01:44.257 --> 00:01:46.672
- You're like giving him
too much of what he wants.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:47.949
You keep texting him.

00:01:47.949 --> 00:01:50.689
You have to do what I
do, just be like, "Hey."

00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:52.262
And then they respond

00:01:52.262 --> 00:01:54.909
and then you don't
answer for like six days.

00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:56.928
Hey, I'm using your toothbrush.

00:01:56.928 --> 00:01:58.460
- You're beautiful.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.598
- You're beautiful.

00:01:59.598 --> 00:02:00.911
- You're beautiful!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.261
- I miss your Mom.

00:02:03.261 --> 00:02:05.978
Do you ever think about when we grow older

00:02:05.978 --> 00:02:07.626
how we should get houses
next to each other

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:10.204
and, you know, have kids,

00:02:10.204 --> 00:02:11.126
and they can be best friends?

00:02:11.126 --> 00:02:12.217
- Yes!

00:02:12.217 --> 00:02:13.239
Except in my fantasy,

00:02:13.239 --> 00:02:14.632
they grow up and they fall in love,

00:02:14.632 --> 00:02:15.561
and they get married,

00:02:15.561 --> 00:02:17.882
and then we get to be like in-laws.

00:02:17.882 --> 00:02:19.461
- Oh my God, and then
they could have kids,

00:02:19.461 --> 00:02:21.992
and then you and I can
be the best grandmas.

00:02:21.992 --> 00:02:23.496
- The coolest grandmas.

